8|0@Aquariums^1439065315#ctw7lg9:VitaP$:We're not saying that's bad. Of course fish eat other fish. Fish meal is one of the top ingredients in flakes. We're saying that feeder fish are hosts to disease and not the healthiest option usually. As in, the same thing you could reasonably say about eating improperly prepared or fatty foods for people. Of course people do it and do it often. It doesn't mean the risk of disease isn't present nor does it mean that it's the best option.
